## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical OS engineering skills: per-NUMA throttling, interaction with the block layer, and robust fairness under bursty multi-tenant workloads.

## Key Concepts

- Token bucket per container; per-node refills to respect locality
- Enqueue/dequeue paths to the I/O submission path
- Cross-node fairness and eviction of bursts

## Code Example

